问你的 Coin、订单与卡牌资产。'}}</p><div class="tabs" v-if="key==='login'"><button type="button" class="active">密码登录</button><button type="button">验证码登录</button></div><div class="field"><label>邮箱或手机号</label><input required placeholder="name@example.com / +1"></div><div class="field" v-if="!['forgot-password','account-activation'].includes(key)"><label>密码</label><input type="password" required></div><template v-if="key==='register'||key==='account-activation'"><div class="field"><label>出生日期</label><input type="date" required></div><label class="consent"><input type="checkbox" required> 我确认已年满 18 周岁，并同意服务条款与隐私政策</label></template><button class="btn btn-primary">继续</button><RouterLink v-if="key==='login'" to="/forgot-password">忘记密码？</RouterLink><RouterLink v-if="key==='login'" to="/register">还没有账户？立即注册</RouterLink></form></section></main></template>
